{"t":"Yalaharian Outfits Quest","s":"yalaharian-outfits-quest-d5545","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Male_Addon_3_ea5554.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Yalaharian Outfits Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80<br/>(120+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>/<a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Lots of creatures in the quarters of <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a> (including <a href=\"#/wiki/Azerus\">Azerus</a>), plus <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">Slime</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantula</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Treeling\">Haunted Treeling</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeleton</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Bonelord\">Elder Bonelord</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Elemental\">Energy Elemental</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelord</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bat</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellspawn\">Hellspawn</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare\">Nightmare</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Scion\">Nightmare Scion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightstalker\">Nightstalker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Bat\">Mutated Bat</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spectre\">Spectre</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\">Werewolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zombie\">Zombie</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Bride\">Vampire Bride</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fury\">Fury</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturer</a>, also some boss monsters like <a href=\"#/wiki/Boreth\">Boreth</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lersatio\">Lersatio</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Marziel\">Marziel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei\">Arthei</a> and some more.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalaharian%20Outfits\">Yalaharian Outfits</a> and only one of two addons, with their respective <a href=\"#/wiki/Achievements\">achievement</a>: <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20of%20Wisdom\">Yalahari of Wisdom</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20of%20Power\">Yalahari of Power</a> <br/><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Male_Addon_3_ea5554.gif\" width=\"128\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_Addon_3_2ce6d4.gif\" width=\"128\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Note: this outfit quest is special, because you will only be able to obtain one of two available addons, not both.</b>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Outfit\">Outfit</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Male_3bb2cf.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_f9af81.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Complete the <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sage_Addon\">Sage Addon</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Male_Addon_1_5e5cdb.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_Addon_1_1cc0c0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampiric%20Crest\">Vampiric Crest</a> (obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>).</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h4>\n<p>After completing the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>, bring the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampiric%20Crest\">Vampiric Crest</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Palimuth\">Palimuth</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, if you choose Palimuth's side in mission 9 of the <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">Yalahar main quest</a> you will get this addon. To obtain the addon say <b>addon</b> to Palimuth while holding the crest. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Villain_Addon\">Villain Addon</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Male_Addon_2_762393.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_Addon_2_ffcf6f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment_2\">Required Equipment</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampiric%20Crest\">Vampiric Crest</a> (obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>).</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method_2\">Method</span></h4>\n<p>After completing the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>, bring the <a href=\"#/wiki/Vampiric%20Crest\">Vampiric Crest</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Palimuth\">Palimuth</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, if you choose <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20%28NPC%29\">Azerus</a>' side in mission 9 of the <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">Yalahar main quest</a> you will get this addon. To obtain the addon say <b>addon</b> to Palimuth while holding the crest.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest","in-service-of-yalahar-quest"]}